  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T K.115 specifies mitigation methods against electromagnetic (EM) security threats such as high-altitude electromagnetic pulse (HEMP), high-power electromagnetic (HPEM), information leakage and lightning for telecommunication equipment and facilities. This Recommendation applies to all types of telecommunication equipment and facilities such as switching equipment, modems and buildings where equipment is installed.</abstract>
